<header><p class="enc-kicker">Term</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sumptuary law</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as sumptuary</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">A sumptuary law is a law that restricts consumption, such as clothing or luxury goods, often according to social rank. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/han-dynasty">Han Dynasty</a> profile notes that merchants were subject to sumptuary restrictions. These reflected the Confucian view that merchants ranked below farmers.</p></div>
